{"ID":"20240504170636-ekw81gf","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504170636-ekw81gf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170636-ekw81gf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504172004-8egf6zw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611131735-pa561np\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624124736-qfz7lsz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"160瓜蒌根（栝楼根、天花粉、栝蒌根）","type":"doc","updated":"20240813151259"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240504172004-a0sanin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504172004-a0sanin","updated":"20240504172004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河北、山东、陕西、山西等地。\n【性状】\t该品呈不规则圆柱形、纺锤形或瓣块状，长816cm，直径1.55.5cm。表面黄白色或淡棕黄色，有纵皱纹，细根痕及略凹陷的横长皮孔，有的有黄棕色外皮残留。质坚实，断面白色或淡黄色，富粉性，横切面可见黄色木质部，“筋脉点”略呈放射状排列，纵剖面可见黄色纵条纹状木质部。无臭，味微苦。\n【性味】\t甘、微苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t清热泻火，生津止渴，排脓消肿。治热病口渴、消渴、黄疸、肺燥咳血、痈肿、痔痿。对于治疗糖尿病，常用它与滋阴药配合使用，以达到标本兼治的作用。\n【注解】\t“筋脉点”：指药材组织内的纤维或维管束，在药材横切面上，呈现出的点状痕迹。"}]},{"ID":"20240504172004-cpkagau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504172004-cpkagau","updated":"20240813150707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206092348-7h2lpjz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240504172004-1vhun3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504172004-1vhun3y","updated":"20240813150708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天花粉"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天花粉-20240205160050-qgbd1pp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624123933-vosk6su","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624123933-vosk6su","updated":"20240813150710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 341px;","style":"width: 331px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栝楼根2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栝楼根2-20240624123937-g2xbt7o.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 331px;\" parent-style=\"width: 341px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栝楼根3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栝楼根3-20240624123943-mkpxu7c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813150803-rb9nq9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813150803-rb9nq9c","updated":"20240813151117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 395px;","style":"width: 385px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓜蒌根"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓜蒌根-20240813150803-l5oak7a.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 385px;\" parent-style=\"width: 395px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 339px;","style":"width: 329px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓜蒌根 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest"